		<title type="html"><![CDATA[W1AEX - DMR + ANALOG + PUB SVC Connecticut USA]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=504&amp;p=4123#p4123"><![CDATA[
The codeplug is ready-to-go for Connecticut, just install your own DMR-ID (General Setting) and Talker Alias information (Boot Item) and load it up. It contains Brandmeister, ARES, and DMARC repeaters from around the state. The following zones are installed:<br><br>PUB-SVC (police, fire, ems)<br>FRS<br>MARINE BAND (4 busy frequencies)<br>NOAA<br>HAM A REPEATERS (analog)<br>HAM A SIMPLEX (analog)<br>DMR SIMPLEX<br>DMR DMARC<br>DMR ARES<br>DMR BM<br>DMR ALL<br>DMR LOCAL<br>ZUMSPOT<br><br>73, Rob W1AEX<dl class="file"><dt><span class="imageset icon_topic_attach"></span> <a class="postlink" href="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=485&amp;sid=545b8c68cfd2e7a649abb06e3163c162">OpenGD-77_01_07_2020_Connecticut.g77</a></dt></dl><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=125">W1AEX</a> — Sat Jan 18, 2020 4:03 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
